        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>15-3/4 Inch Extra Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 15-3/4\" long sliding door flush pull has very clean lines. Concealed mounting holes add to the clean contemporary styling. This extra long rectangular flush pull is for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors, or any door where a \"flush with the door face\" pull is desired. It comes packaged with stainless steel mounting screws for easy installation. Available in your choice of Satin Stainless Steel or Polished Stainless Steel finish. The finger opening has a nice easy grab lip.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-718-400_size.gif?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"500\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Extra Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull  Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/11-13-16-inch-long-stainless-steel-flush-pull\"><b>11-13/16 Inch Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/7-7-8-inch-stainless-steel-flush-pull\"><b>7-7/8 Inch Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 15-3/4 Inch Extra Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 15-3/4\" (400 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-3/16\" (56 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1/2\" (13 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 7/16\" (11 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Height: 14-9/16\" (370 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Width: 1-1/32\" (26 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 15-1/2\" (394 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-15/16\" (50 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
