                "description": "The 15-3/4 inch long sliding door flush pull has very clean lines. Concealed mounting holes add to the clean contemporary styling. This extra long rectangular flush pull is for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors, or any door where a \"flush with the door face\" pull is desired. It comes packaged with stainless steel mounting screws for easy installation. Available in your choice of Satin Stainless Steel or Polished Stainless Steel finish. The finger opening has a nice easy grab lip.",
